@title 3D vents: a device a hair over its limit reads just over on the label and in the panel line
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The same cabinet as scenario 231 with T1 limit lowered by half a kelvin (fixture made by qa/fixtures/make_vents_fixtures.py), so T1 ends between 0 and 0.5 K over. The panel line says "just over its limit" and the label "just over limit" in the Over colour, not "0 K over". Both are drawn text the harness cannot read, so the picture is the evidence; the finished run is checked.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-vents-just-over.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 170
expect_not "A run is going on the openings"
shot 01-at-its-limit
check_layout
check_blank 01-at-its-limit
